# Cross-confirm twin of screens_fast.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# Fast capture route: skips the opening (CIRCLE at 400, START at 460;
# title at ~408). Same screens as scripts/screens.script, used by
# scripts/check_scripts.sh.
400:4000:5
460:0008:5
@1+60:0008:5
@1+200:0020:5
@1+260:0020:5
@1+320:0020:5
@1+380:0020:5
@1+700:4000:5
@1+1000:4000:5
@1+1300:4000:5
@1+1500:4000:5
